reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md:69:- Settlement guard: `arraysubs_is_awaiting_gateway_settlement()` → skip (`:684-689`).
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md-70-- On hold: `wp_update_post(status=arraysubs-on-hold)`, `_on_hold_date = now` (UTC mysql), `do_action('arraysubs_data_put_on_hold')` (`:692-701`).
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md-71-
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md-72-**Effective on-hold moment** = first hourly `arraysubs_check_overdue_renewals` tick where `now > max(D + 1 day, D + offset + 1h)`. With offset ≤ 6 h, `D + 1 day` dominates. So: **≈ D + 24h, rounded up to the next hourly sweep.**
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md-73-
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md-74-### Phase 2 — ON-HOLD → CANCELLED (`processOnHoldToCancelBatch()` `Hooks.php:715-760`)
