reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md-76-- SQL cutoff `cancel_cutoff = gmdate(now − (1 + 3) = 4 days)`; selects `post_status = arraysubs-on-hold AND _next_payment_date < cutoff` (`:718-726`).
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md:77:- **Additional** per-row gate on `_on_hold_date`: skip while `time() < on_hold_ts + 3*DAY_IN_SECONDS` (`:735-743`).
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md-78-- Settlement guard again (`:747-752`).
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md-79-- `RenewalProcessor::cancelOverdueSubscription()` (`:756`, impl `RenewalProcessor.php:139-174`): status → `arraysubs-cancelled`; `_end_date`, `_cancelled_date` = now; `_cancelled_by = 'system'`; `_cancellation_reason = 'overdue_payment'`; cancels every unpaid renewal order (`cancelPendingRenewalOrders()` `:182-263`); `RenewalScheduler::unschedule()`; `do_action('arraysubs_data_cancelled_overdue')`.
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md-80-
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md-81-**Effective cancel moment** = `max(D + 4 days, on_hold_date + 3 days)`, rounded up to the next hourly sweep. Because on-hold lands at ≈ D+24h, both terms coincide at **≈ D + 4 days**.
