reference/SLT-REF-07-early-renew-and-late-renew-date-amount-effects-catch-up-vs-s.md-96-When sync is on and the computed boundary lands in the past, `advanceSyncedBoundaryPastDue()` walks it forward one interval at a time (max **600** advances) until it is in the future, and writes a subscription note naming how many billing dates passed unbilled (`OrderIntegration.php:1549-1620`). **Skipped cycles are NOT billed** — they are recorded and forfeited.
